#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""catalogs_w14.py — replacement formula-catalog chapters for the Math I and
Linear Algebra I Weeks 1-4 study guides.

The current guides inherited their catalogs from a degraded re-render in which
every formula had been flattened into running text.  The original v1 combined
guides (Study_Guide_Weeks_1-4_{RU,EN,UZ}.pdf, commits 0306010) instead typeset
each catalog entry as a CENTERED DISPLAY EQUATION with a right-aligned number
(1)-(117).  This module restores that layout: content transcribed from the v1
catalogs, each chapter a list of entries

    ('h3', title)          subsection heading inside the catalog
    ('p', text)            intro paragraph (runs through texify; inline math OK)
    ('eq', 'N', latex)     numbered display equation  -> \\begin{equation}\\tag{N}
    ('eqnn', latex)        unnumbered centered display
    ('table', NAME)        hand-built table by global name in build_guide.py
    ('caption', text)      small italic caption line under a table

Author errors found in v1 are corrected (noted inline); the rest of the content
is transcribed verbatim from the v1 catalog pages.
"""

